<title>INDIA: Indian castor futures market closed for Christmas.</title>
<headline>Indian castor futures market closed for Christmas.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bombay Oilseeds and Oils Exchange was closed on Wednesday for Christmas.</p>
<p>It will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, castorseed March delivery prices fell to 1,186/1,187 rupees per quintal on Tuesday after rising to 1,191/1,192 rupees.</p>
<p>Groundnut oil fell from 344/345 rupees to 340/341 rupees per 10 kg on higher arrivals and sluggish physical buying. In Rajkot spot oil fell by five rupees to 520/525 rupees per 15 kg.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
